    "sourceExport": "Archived packed 8K rigged Tripo GLB, SHA256 f261d38aa4b9e32815750fea9a97cfa0a0c35210eb14df36432363395e748a6e. Authored base-color, normal and packed metal/roughness maps retained and resized to 2K runtime maps. Smart UV retained; no retopology. Current source joint world matrices neutralize the corrupt source skin weights before the importer geometry-based rebind.",
